Phosphor CRT (磷光 CRT)
=======================

Unofficial fan artwork. Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or licensed from
CD Projekt Red, Studio Trigger, or the creators of Cyberpunk: Edgerunners.

Artwork provenance
------------------

Every raster asset in skins/crt-phosphor/assets/ originates from this project's
own AI generations (made for its predecessor project through the OFOX image API,
model volcengine/doubao-seedream-5.0-pro) and is processed locally:

  scene-light.webp / scene-dark.webp
      a character-free night-city scene, converted to a P1 phosphor duotone with
      halation, baked scanlines, a vignette and grain (tools/build_crt_assets.py)

  lucy-signal-left.webp / lucy-signal-right.webp
      full-body portraits that were drawn on a flat magenta plate and keyed
      locally (chroma-key estimation, alpha ramp, unmix, despill, despeckle)

No photograph, cosplay image, or other third-party picture was sent to any
model: the character was described in text only.

